<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan CPC revises petrochemical prices.</title>
<headline>Taiwan CPC revises petrochemical prices.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-run Chinese Petroleum Corp said on Saturday it revised product prices in August, in U.S. dollars per tonne.</p>
<p>PRODUCT					    August	   July</p>
<p>Ethylene					    530		524</p>
<p>Polymer grade propylene			 420		420</p>
<p>Chemical grade propylene			387		387</p>
<p>Butadiene					   413		408</p>
<p>Benzene					     287		284</p>
<p>Paraxylene					  496		492</p>
<p>Orthoxylene					 360		354</p>
<p>Carbon black feedstock (per kilolitre)    121		118</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
